<title>UK: BOE invites no further money mkt operations.</title>
<headline>BOE invites no further money mkt operations.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England did not invite any further operations on Tuesday after revising its money market forecast to 1.1 billion stg.</p>
<p>Earlier, the Bank provided liquidity to the market totalling 1.125 billion stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
